 "_comment": [
  "PLACE WORDS FOR SCENE NAMES (Scenes, beta 3.1).",
  "When an adult names (or renames) a scene, any keyword below that appears as a word in the name (not case sensitive; 'parks' matches 'park';",
  "'bath time' matches 'bathtime' and 'bath-time') adds that place's words to a group called 'Words for <scene name>' in the scene editor.",
  "They are checkboxes that start UNCHECKED. Several matching places are merged (a word listed twice appears once).",
  "Every word is a VOICE word id from the board (the id is what the board uses internally; its picture and spoken text come from the board).",
  "'places' = one entry per place: its keywords and its words (in the order shown).",
  "'fromObjects' = when the photo's recognized things include one of these names (or a hand-drawn thing is one of these board word ids), the",
  "place is suggested even if the scene's name has no keyword: for example a recognized 'oven' suggests the 'food' place (Kitchen and food).",
  "You can edit this file with any text editor; save it as plain text (JSON) and keep the commas and quotes."
 ],
